<item>
<title>India: Kashmir, Manipur and the Maoist belt: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/india/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-india-2026-10-31T13:46:28.531Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 31 Oct 2026 13:46:28 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;India raised its fiscal-year growth forecast while security forces in Chhattisgarh uncovered a Maoist weapons cache. In Kashmir, two militants were detained for involvement in a kidnapping and ambulances were stranded as students missed classes during a convoy, while the Mirwaiz urged release of political prisoners and restoration of civil liberties. In Manipur, large rallies demanded the abrogation of the SoO agreement and safe return of IDPs, the state announced ex-gratia for families of 32 Kuki-Zo civilians killed, and children continue to be born in displacement camps. 437 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dw.com/en/india-increases-growth-forecast-for-fiscal-year/a-79798971?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-rdf&quot;&gt;Deutsche Welle&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;India Today&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hawk&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;India Today&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;ANI News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;ThePrint&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Deccan Chronicle&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hans India&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;India Today NE&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
